      "widgets_values": [
        "## 8B ClipProj实际桥接\r\n\r\n需要单独安装 nicolab28/ComfyUI-ClipProj >= 0.1.13 并重启ComfyUI。编码器：qwen3vl_8b_fp8_scaled.safetensors；矩阵：mmh3-8b-ClipProj-v3.1.safetensors。本机审核矩阵固定到HF revision 2ebdbcdc27a29a9607efdb221a9afcb9a0cdd808，SHA-256 DF0661849D0FD51DB66B0C9AA76F2C1C3EABD81B9A4745EDD2A4617AB24C87F7。"
